{% macro handoff_preamble(upstream_phase, upstream_complete_sentence, must_instruction) %}
**{{ upstream_phase }} phase is already complete** — {{ upstream_complete_sentence }}

**Handoff contract (tied to the phase and role labels you were given)**: {{ must_instruction }}

Do not invent a different binary path that bypasses the upstream contract. If context or an upstream artifact tells you to use a specific executable location "AAA", then "AAA" must have been produced by the responsible upstream phase. Verifying upstream success at that exact location is part of fulfilling this phase.
{% endmacro %}
